mira-runtime — third-party notices
==================================

This crate composes `mira-agent` and `mira-ai`. It is informed by the session
and agent boundaries of the Pi project (`packages/agent`, `packages/coding-agent`
and `packages/durable`) from the Pi repository, reference commit `a276dabe5`.

The crate is not a Pi port. No Pi coding-agent, CLI, extension, tool, skill,
subagent, OAuth or durable-session code was translated. `mira-runtime` adds
Rust-native session composition on top of the two lower Mira packages: an
explicit model registry, a caller-owned credential resolver, caller-owned
context providers and one finite total time budget per run. The intentional
differences, including everything that is deliberately not implemented, are
listed in README.md. No durable state is provided.

